flowchart TD
    subgraph EnterpriseSolutions[Enterprise Solutions]
        database[fa:fa-database Enterprise Database]
        harddrive[fa:fa-hard-drive Hard Drive]
        api[fa:fa-algolia Enterprise API]
        database ~~~ harddrive ~~~ api
    end
    
    subgraph Tools[fa:fa-toolbox Independent Tools]
        schema[fa:fa-database Database Schema Extractor]
        queryRunner[fa:fa-code Query Runner]
        graphPlotter[fa:fa-chart-area Graph Plotter]
        apiCaller[fa:fa-python API Invocation]
        summarizer[fa:fa-clipboard-list fa:fa-brain Summarizer LLM]
        schema ~~~ queryRunner ~~~ graphPlotter ~~~ apiCaller ~~~ summarizer
    end
    subgraph Orchestrator[fa:fa-robot fa:fa-brain Orchestrator Agent]
        memory[fa:fa-memory Memory Buffer]
        orchstratorPrompt[fa:fa-comment Orchestrator System Prompt] --> memory
        orchestratorLlm[fa:fa-brain Orchestrator LLM]
        memory --> orchestratorLlm

        %% orchestrator flow to be commented before lecture
        orchestratorLlm --> planningStep{🤔 Let Me Think}
        planningStep --> |Not In Tool Scope|AnswerDirectly
        planningStep --> |Tool Call|ToolCalls[Sequence of Tool Calls]
        planningStep --> |No more tool call Needed|AnswerFromMemory[Summarize and Answer from Memory]
        
    end
    UserTask[fa:fa-user User Task]
    UserTask --> memory
    %% Create tool connections
    database --> schema
    database --> queryRunner
    graphPlotter --> harddrive
    Tools --> orchestratorLlm
    api --> apiCaller
    
    %% agentic flow to nbe commented before lecturr
    ToolCalls --> |Call Tools in same seq|Tools
    Tools --> |Register Each Tool Call Output in Memory|memory
